e than any other pair. In 2025 that same pair on the middle of the grids came in at 51% of normal, and January to February was 54%. So far in 2026, April to May on the middle of the grids came in at 66% of normal. All 4 grids had their driest year in 1965, with grid 24825 at 60%.</p>"}
